{"id":"00596","root":"uni00596_1","name":{"ja":"人外のお諒","en":"Inhuman Oryou"},"title":{"ja":"【水着】","en":"【Swimsuit】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【水着】 人外のお諒","en":"【Swimsuit】 Inhuman Oryou"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2022-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":131,"profile":{"ja":"魔族。かつて魔術師に支配されていたアミダハラのナカノシマ地区を制したギャング団の幹部。魔族の中では高貴な家柄の出身だが、魔族の中で時折うまれる“忌子”だったため、領内の小作人に預けられて育てられる。忌子とは異形の姿で生まれてくる赤子の事で、次元を超越する古き神々が産ませた子といわれ不吉とされている。迫害されたお諒はやがて故郷を出て人間界へと至り、種族、出自を問わず仲間は皆兄弟として平等に扱うナカノシマギャング団に入団、すぐに頭角を現し３番隊隊長となる。魔界の特殊で希少な金属“オリハルコン”で作られた金属バットが彼女の得物。普段は人間の少女と変わらぬ姿だが、彼女の真の姿“異形”の姿へ変ずると恐るべき身体能力を発揮するという。しかしお諒は異形の姿に強いコンプレックスを抱いていて、よほどの理由がなければ異形モードには変化しない。","en":"A demon. Formerly an executive of the gang that seized the Nakano-shima district of Amida-hara, which had been ruled by sorcerers. Though she comes from a noble demon lineage, she was born as an \"Iko\"—a child with a monstrous form considered an omen, said to be spawned by ancient gods beyond dimensions. Persecuted as an Iko, she left her homeland for the Human Realm and joined the Nakano-shima gang, which treats all comrades as equal brothers regardless of race or origin. She quickly rose to prominence and became captain of the 3rd Squad. Her weapon is a metal bat forged from the rare demonic alloy orichalcum. She usually appears indistinguishable from a human girl, but when she transforms into her true \"aberrant\" form she gains terrifying physical abilities. However, Oryou harbors a deep complex about that form and will not shift into it unless absolutely necessary."},"illustrator":"こめつぶ","voiceActor":"奥寺かすみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00596_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[156,312],"def":[133,266],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","1520001"],"evolve":[["evo00001",5],["evo00002",15],["evo00003",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00596_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1